        <description>MakeLabels is a tool for generating PDS4 labels by combining a label template with values from one or more Excel spreadsheets. It replaces template placeholders with spreadsheet content and can also be used to produce other types of ASCII output files. A graphical interface is available for rapid or occasional use, while the command-line version supports automated workflows. The tool is useful for investigators preparing data submissions to the PDS.</description>
